<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TGS started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TGS started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- HSBC James Capel analyst Javier Finkman started coverage of Argentina's Transportadora de Gas del Sur SA Thursday with a rating of hold.</p>
<p>-- He called the company &quot;fairly valued&quot; and said contracted demand generated stable cash flows.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Current regulatory review of tariffs is a substantial risk,&quot; Finkman wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were up 1/8 to 12-5/8 in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
